SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Holy Cross (Stavros)\, Emporio
LOCATION:Emporio\, Santorini\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Emporio\, the big medieval village in the south\, celebrates the Exaltation of the Cross on 13-14 September with a liturgy and a panigiri in the square: local wine\, food\, music and dancing. Mid-September is grape-harvest time\, so the wine is new and the village is in a good mood.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#emporio-panigiri-of-the-holy-cross-stavros-emporio
